+--------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : C2 = coneFromVData matrix {{1,0,1},{0,1,0},{1,1,0}}|
|                                                        |
|o2 = C2                                                 |
|                                                        |
|o2 : Cone                                               |
+--------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : C1 ? C2                                            |
|                                                        |
|o3 = <                                                  |
|                                                        |
|o3 : Keyword                                            |
+--------------------------------------------------------+

