directProduct(Cone,Cone) -- computes the direct product of polyhedra and cones
******************************************************************************

  * Function: *note directProduct: (Macaulay2Doc)directProduct,
  * Usage: 
        P = directProduct(X,Y)
  * Inputs:
      * X, a *note convex rational cone: Cone,, *note Cone: Cone, or *note
        Polyhedron: Polyhedron,
      * Y, a *note convex rational cone: Cone,, *note Cone: Cone, or *note
        Polyhedron: Polyhedron,
  * Outputs:
      * P, *note Cone: Cone, or *note Polyhedron: Polyhedron,

Description
===========


The directProduct of X and Y is the polyhedron {(x,y) | x in X, y in Y} in the
direct product of the ambient spaces. If X and Y are both cones, then the
direct product is again a cone and the output is then also given as a *note
Cone: Cone,, otherwise as a *note Polyhedron: Polyhedron,.
+--------------------------------------+
|i1 : P = hypercube 1                  |
|                                      |
|o1 = P                                |
|                                      |
|o1 : Polyhedron                       |
+--------------------------------------+
|i2 : Q = hypercube 2                  |
|                                      |
|o2 = Q                                |
|                                      |
|o2 : Polyhedron                       |
+--------------------------------------+
|i3 : directProduct(P,Q) == hypercube 3|
|                                      |
|o3 = true                             |
+--------------------------------------+


See also *note Cone * Cone: Cone _st Cone,, *note Cone * Polyhedron: Cone _st
Polyhedron,, *note Polyhedron * Cone: Polyhedron _st Cone,, and *note
Polyhedron * Polyhedron: Polyhedron _st Polyhedron,.

Ways to use this method:
========================

  * *note directProduct(Cone,Cone): directProduct_lpCone_cmCone_rp, -- computes
    the direct product of polyhedra and cones
  * "directProduct(Cone,Polyhedron)"
  * "directProduct(Polyhedron,Cone)"
  * "directProduct(Polyhedron,Polyhedron)"
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

