fan(PolyhedralComplex) -- Take the fan over a polyhedral complex
****************************************************************

  * Function: *note fan: fan,
  * Usage: 
        F = fan PC
  * Inputs:
      * PC, an instance of the type *note PolyhedralComplex:
        PolyhedralComplex,,
  * Outputs:
      * F, an instance of the type *note Fan: Fan,, 

Description
===========

The polyhedral complex is embedded at height one and the fan is taken over it.

+-------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : C = hypercube 2                                         |
|                                                             |
|o1 = C                                                       |
|                                                             |
|o1 : Polyhedron                                              |
+-------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : F = faces(1,C)                                          |
|                                                             |
|o2 = {({0, 2}, {}), ({1, 3}, {}), ({0, 1}, {}), ({2, 3}, {})}|
|                                                             |
|o2 : List                                                    |
+-------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : V = vertices C                                          |
|                                                             |
|o3 = | -1 1  -1 1 |                                          |
|     | -1 -1 1  1 |                                          |
|                                                             |
|              2       4                                      |
|o3 : Matrix QQ  <-- QQ                                       |
+-------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : L = linealitySpace C                                    |
|                                                             |
|o4 = 0                                                       |
|                                                             |
|              2                                              |
|o4 : Matrix QQ  <-- 0                                        |
+-------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : PC = polyhedralComplex(V,L,F)                           |
|                                                             |
|o5 = PC                                                      |
|                                                             |
|o5 : PolyhedralComplex                                       |
+-------------------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : vertices PC                                             |
|                                                             |
|o6 = | -1 1  -1 1 |                                          |
|     | -1 -1 1  1 |                                          |
|                                                             |
|              2       4                                      |
|o6 : Matrix QQ  <-- QQ                                       |
+-------------------------------------------------------------+
|i7 : maxPolyhedra PC                                         |
|                                                             |
|o7 = {({0, 2}, {}), ({1, 3}, {}), ({0, 1}, {}), ({2, 3}, {})}|
|                                                             |
|o7 : List                                                    |
+-------------------------------------------------------------+
|i8 : dim PC                                                  |
|                                                             |
|o8 = 1                                                       |
+-------------------------------------------------------------+

