|                            |
|o1 = P                      |
|                            |
|o1 : Polyhedron             |
+----------------------------+
|i2 : fVector P              |
|                            |
|o2 = {5, 9, 6, 1}           |
|                            |
|o2 : List                   |
+----------------------------+

