inInterior -- checks if a point lies in the relative interior of a Cone/Polyhedron
**********************************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        b = inInterior(p,C) 
        b = inInterior(p,P)
  * Inputs:
      * p, a *note matrix: (Macaulay2Doc)Matrix,,  over *note ZZ:
        (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ, or *note QQ: (Macaulay2Doc)QQ, with only one column
