polar --  computes the polar of a polyhedron
********************************************

  * Usage: 
        Pv = polar P
  * Inputs:
      * P, a *note convex polyhedron: Polyhedron,
  * Outputs:
      * Pv, a *note convex polyhedron: Polyhedron,

Description
===========


The polar polyhedron of P in n-space is the polyhedron in the dual space given
by {v in (QQ^n)^* | v*p >= -1 for all p in P}.
+-------------------------+
|i1 : P = hypercube 3     |
|                         |
|o1 = P                   |
|                         |
|o1 : Polyhedron          |
+-------------------------+
|i2 : Q = polar P         |
|                         |
|o2 = Q                   |
|                         |
|o2 : Polyhedron          |
+-------------------------+
|i3 : Q == crossPolytope 3|
|                         |
|o3 = true                |
+-------------------------+

