  * "polyhedralComplex(Matrix,Matrix,List)"
  * *note polyhedralComplex(Matrix,Matrix,Matrix,List):
    polyhedralComplex_lpMatrix_cmMatrix_cmMatrix_cmList_rp, -- Constructing a
    polyhedral complex.
