Description
===========

PolyhedralObject is the parent class of the four polyhedral objects in
Polyhedra:
  * *note Cone: Cone,
  * *note Polyhedron: Polyhedron,
  * *note Fan: Fan,
  * *note PolyhedralComplex: PolyhedralComplex,
