|i1 : coneFromVData matrix {{1,2},{2,1}}     |
|                                            |
|o1 = Cone{...1...}                          |
|                                            |
|o1 : Cone                                   |
+--------------------------------------------+
|i2 : convexHull matrix {{1,1,0,0},{1,0,1,0}}|
|                                            |
|o2 = Polyhedron{...1...}                    |
|                                            |
|o2 : Polyhedron                             |
+--------------------------------------------+
|i3 : hirzebruch 3                           |
|                                            |
|o3 = Fan{...1...}                           |
|                                            |
|o3 : Fan                                    |
+--------------------------------------------+
|i4 : polyhedralComplex crossPolytope 3      |
|                                            |
