|                       |
|o1 = P                 |
|                       |
|o1 : Polyhedron        |
+-----------------------+
|i2 : vertices P        |
|                       |
|o2 = | 1 0 0 |         |
|     | 0 1 0 |         |
|     | 0 0 1 |         |
|                       |
|              3       3|
|o2 : Matrix QQ  <-- QQ |
+-----------------------+

