stellarSubdivision -- computes the stellar subdivision of the fan by a ray
**************************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        F1 = stellarSubdivision(F,r)
  * Inputs:
      * F, an instance of the type *note Fan: Fan,
      * r, a *note matrix: (Macaulay2Doc)Matrix,, with one column in the
        ambient space of the fan
  * Outputs:
      * F1, an instance of the type *note Fan: Fan,

Description
===========


This function computes the stellar subdivision of F by inserting the ray given
by r.
+---------------------------------+
|i1 : F = normalFan hypercube 2   |
|                                 |
|o1 = F                           |
|                                 |
|o1 : Fan                         |
+---------------------------------+
|i2 : r = matrix {{1},{1}}        |
|                                 |
|o2 = | 1 |                       |
